# Build artifacts
dist/
node_modules/

# The embedded engine (apps/console/engine) is deliberately NOT ignored: it is a
# tracked distribution artifact, and its manifest binds the packaged engine to the
# exact source commit. Ignoring it let the committed bundle drift behind the
# authoritative root source while its self-manifest still looked consistent.
# Regenerate it with `node scripts/console/sync-engine.mjs` and verify with
# `--check`; both are enforced by tests/console-engine-parity.test.js.

# OS / editor
*.swp
Thumbs.db
